  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **transdermal**: rare: 5 archived performances [4]\n- **DC weekend (new song, first time played)**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **pumpin' for the man**: back after 184 archived shows (2225 days) [4]\n- **the fruit man (new song, first time played)**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: fiesta (new song, first time played), the party, fiesta (new song, second time played), fiesta (new song, third time played) [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Ween2007-04-26** (recommended): source not stated; 30 songs; 141 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]\n- **ween2007-04-26.merin**: source not stated; 30 songs; 140 min [2]. Said about its sound: Uploader warns that the PA produced audible crackling, which is captured in the recording [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2007-04-26.merin**: taped by Jon Merin; transferred by Jon Merin; source: Schoeps MK4(DIN)>kcy>Sonosax SX-M2/LS>Hydra Silver XLR Interconnects >Sound Devices 722(24/96) [2]",
